Before we get into today’s breakdown just wanted to say how appreciative I am to Powell for dropping sauce for us and to @Domme for answering some of my questions, legit joined this group 4-5 days ago and am already up around 6k, shit is retarded as fuck. Anyways enough glazing onto the breakdown  coming into market open we decided to just rip upwards, there where no entries for this so waited for 10 am to see if we could get an entry their, we didnt seem to want to pull back that far, after this jumped onto the 4hr to see we had a nice OB sat in the ote   after this jumped over to the 1 hour to see we had a nice hourly fvg and RB which alligned nicely with the 4hr OB and still sat in that htf OTE, these 2 HTFs gave me everything i needed to. start looking for an entry around these areas   when we first came up to the 1 hr fvg we gave a nice reaction and created a 1 min RB that was not valid due to the shitty distrubution candle that formed it so didnt end up taking it that time round, however we ended up distrubuting lower which validated the 1 min RB and formed a nice 5 min RB which was used as my ET  if your wondering why i didnt limit the ce of the 5 min rb, its for 2 reasons,   1. we where not in ltf FIb we where actually to discounted for fib which means that my logic of "take the most discounted entry" doesnt apply in this case   2. we where already trading very closley to the top of the hourly fvg meaning that if we did go up to the CE of the 5 min it was likely we would keep pushing bullish and inverse the imbalce   for my SL i had it placed just above the RB which was exactly 10 points, this was also above the hourly gap   for my TP my target was the eq of the range which alligned closely with a 5 min imbalance and 1 min liq   STATS  win  80.25 points   8.03rr   NOTES  gave this one as a signal in the chat and pretty sure a few people took it so w that people banked with me  Any Q just @ me in chat (edited)
